## Source

Since 2026-11-20 this directory is EGA-archive/crypt4gh-rust `main` at commit `2d41a17`
(RustCrypto port contributed by UMCCR), not the crates.io 0.4.1 release. Synaptic Four changes:
(1) the unused GPL-3.0 dependency `ed25519_to_curve25519` is removed from `Cargo.toml`;
(2) debug/info log lines that printed secret key material (private keys, X25519 shared
keys, KDF-derived keys, decrypted private-key blobs) are removed from `src/header.rs`,
`src/keys.rs` and `src/bin.rs`. Those modifications are Apache-2.0. Earlier Synaptic Four modifications (replacing `rust-crypto`) are no
longer present; upstream made the equivalent change.

